  <data name="Trading.Disclaimer.NotAdvice" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>ZettaTrade is educational software, not investment advice. Nothing in this application, its documentation or the AI chat is a recommendation to buy, sell or hold any asset or instrument.</value>
